write('QA/03_TEST_MATRIX.md','# Master test matrix\n\nThis is a scoped scenario backlog, not hundreds of implemented tests. Endpoint cases inherit full request/response/guard detail from [API inventory](INVENTORY/API_ENDPOINTS.md) and [contracts](INVENTORY/CONTRACTS.md); field cases from [field catalog](INVENTORY/FORMS_AND_FIELDS.md). IDs persist in registry.json. Parameter expansions (browser, role, data boundary) are not counted as separate scenarios. P0 priority means must execute before release. Static issues have NOT RUN regressions.\n\n'+table(['Module','Feature','Test ID','Description','Layer','Role','Test priority','Automatable','Current coverage','Status','Related issue','Source'],cases.map(c=>[c.module,c.feature,c.id,c.description,c.layer,c.role,c.priority,c.auto,c.coverage,c.status,c.issue,c.source])));
write('QA/05_BUSINESS_WORKFLOW_MATRIX.md','# Business workflow matrix\n\nDerived from page API calls, controller actions, stores and response paths. These are 24 traceable scenario families, not proof that workflows pass. Each write follows the complete client → request → validation → logic → SQL → serialized response → UI chain. Admin and family/teacher reads must agree on shared data.\n\n'+table(['Module','Workflow','Screen/API/data chain','Required invariant','Test ID','Execution'],workflows.map(w=>[...w,'NOT RUN']))+'\nTeacher compensation stores Monthly/Hourly in Teacher.CompensationJson; payroll independently stores Monthly/SessionBlock in PayrollProfiles. Do not assume editing compensation changes payroll. External Email/WhatsApp delivery is queued/blocked in source; no registered delivery background worker was found. Payment records are offline/manual ledger operations; no card gateway integration was found. Confirm business expectations before adding payment gateway tests.\n');
write('QA/ISSUES/INDEX.md','# Open issue register\n\nAll issues remain OPEN. Static findings require isolated execution; the known UI symptoms are historical reports, not reproduced screenshots at this baseline. Priority and impact severity are separate. No production data was used.\n\n'+table(['Issue ID','Title','Priority','Severity','Evidence type','Regression test'],issues.map(x=>[`[${x.id}](${x.id}.md)`,x.title,x.priority,x.severity,x.observed?'EXECUTED CHECK':'STATIC FINDING / reproduction pending',x.test])));
